  displayName: Biofilm
  description: A community of bacteria wrapped in a slimy matrix of sugars, proteins
    and DNA. The matrix shields them from immune cells and antibiotics, which is
    why biofilms cause stubborn infections. Break the matrix to reach the colony
    inside.
  gameHint: Break the shields, hit the core.
